## Rubric
- [x] Confirm PgControlRecord and persisted PG format do not store/bind the peering-completing primary.
- [x] Confirm complete_pg_peering validates the caller-supplied primary but only stores Active state and bumps cluster_epoch.
- [x] Confirm serving_pg_primary recomputes primary dynamically from current node heartbeat last_observed_epoch/health rather than a persisted peered-primary field.
- [x] Reproduce with public APIs that a non-peering-completing acting-set member can heartbeat first after the peering epoch bump and become serving primary while PG remains Active.
